#: fl_sim.messages:2 of
msgid "fl_sim.messages"
msgstr "fl_sim.messages"

#: fl_sim.messages:4 of
msgid "Typed messages exchanged between the :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server` and :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Client` nodes."
msgstr "在 :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server` 与 :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Client` 节点之间交换的类型化消息。"

#: fl_sim.messages:7 of
msgid "The legacy protocol manipulates the (private) ``_received_messages`` containers directly with magic string keys, e.g."
msgstr "旧式协议直接用魔法字符串键操作（私有的） ``_received_messages`` 容器，例如"

#: fl_sim.messages:19 of
msgid "The typed messages below are the recommended replacement: the message fields are explicit (hence IDE-discoverable and validated by construction), and the (private) legacy containers are populated automatically by :meth:`Client.receive` and :meth:`Server.receive_one`, so that the legacy consumption code (e.g. :meth:`Client.accept_parameters`) keeps working unchanged during the transition."
msgstr "下文的类型化消息是推荐的替代方案：消息字段是显式的（因而可被 IDE 发现并在构造时得到校验），且（私有的）旧式容器会由 :meth:`Client.receive` 与 :meth:`Server.receive_one` 自动填充，因此旧式的消费代码（例如 :meth:`Client.accept_parameters` ）在过渡期间无需修改即可继续工作。"
